{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09118","headline":"送阎寀赴东川辟 · 韦应物","name":"送阎寀赴东川辟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冰炭俱可怀，孰云热与寒。\n何如结发友，不得携手懽。\n晨登严霜野，送子天一端。\n祗承简书命，俯仰豸角冠。\n上陟白云峤，下冥玄壑湍。\n离羣自有托，历险得所安。\n当念反穷巷，登朝成慨叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}